      "content": "counselors dont change the fact that the numbers just dont add up. i've done the math like a hundred times. it's just a loop. i wake up, i work, i pay interest, i owe more than i did yesterday. it feels like there's just no exit. like the walls are closing in and no matter what i do, it just gets tighter.",
